# Deadly Cover-Up with evidence collected: Bot1 exiles Griselbrand (mana value 8) from its graveyard as the additional cost
# (CR 701.59a), then destroys Bot2's two Ornithopters, which land in Bot2's graveyard. Bot1 exiles one of them from there, and
# searches Bot2's graveyard, hand and library for the rest of that name: all of them are exiled, Bot2 shuffles and draws one
# card for the one exiled from its hand (not for the ones from the graveyard and the library).

